WEBVTT

00:00:00.730 --> 00:00:04.550
The recovery team was attacked?

00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:07.520
Yes, and the noro was stolen.

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:09.070
By aradama?

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:10.100
No, not them.

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:13.360
They were attacked by a Toji.

00:00:14.030 --> 00:00:15.900
After an aradama has been destroyed,

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:19.860
the noro recovery team has been 
attacked at several locations.

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:22.370
By aradama?

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:25.870
Well, the culprit is also a Toji.

00:00:26.390 --> 00:00:29.050
A mysterious Toji wearing a hood.

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:37.930
Stop!

00:00:38.770 --> 00:00:40.720
We will cut you down if you resist!

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:54.650
Damn it, the hits just keep on coming!

00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:05.850
Then...

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:08.700
Curse you,

00:01:09.690 --> 00:01:11.460
that's the Niten Ichi style!

00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:15.460
I knew it, you're—

00:01:15.930 --> 00:01:18.380
Shidou Maki.

00:02:50.550 --> 00:02:54.930
<b>Katana Maidens</b>

00:02:55.480 --> 00:03:00.900
<b>Episode 16  Audience In the Prison</b>

00:02:57.940 --> 00:03:01.440
There's no mistake. That is Maki-san.

00:03:03.070 --> 00:03:05.190
Then do you know who this is?

00:03:05.470 --> 00:03:07.570
What kind of ties do they have to each other?

00:03:07.570 --> 00:03:10.950
Are they companions or 
collaborators of some kind?

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:12.820
Not possible.

00:03:12.820 --> 00:03:17.290
Maki-san set out to settle 
things with her past.

00:03:17.710 --> 00:03:20.110
She would not ally with a stranger now.

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:30.850
One of them is definitely Shidou Maki.

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:33.740
But we have no idea who the other one is.

00:03:34.310 --> 00:03:36.480
Perhaps it's the former Origami head?

00:03:36.920 --> 00:03:41.610
Just because she possesses an 
okatana does not make her a Toji.

00:03:42.310 --> 00:03:44.110
What do you mean?

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:24.860
Wanna go one more round?

00:04:24.860 --> 00:04:25.850
Sure.

00:04:30.280 --> 00:04:34.030
Kanamin, Hiyoyon, I'm back!

00:04:34.450 --> 00:04:35.410
Hey!

00:04:35.760 --> 00:04:37.370
Ellen-chan!

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:40.660
The others are with me, too.

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:42.160
We're back!

00:04:42.760 --> 00:04:43.670
'Sup.

00:04:44.150 --> 00:04:45.890
Welcome back, everybody!

00:04:45.890 --> 00:04:48.940
Is everyone at Minoseki doing well, Mai-chan?

00:04:48.940 --> 00:04:50.610
Yes, as usual.

00:04:50.610 --> 00:04:54.180
Also, I brought back your 
assignments, too.

00:04:55.880 --> 00:04:57.430
Good luck with that.

00:04:57.430 --> 00:05:02.020
Kaoru, I've brought back our 
homework from the director, too.

00:05:02.020 --> 00:05:03.520
Not us, too.

00:05:03.520 --> 00:05:06.870
She's been working my fingers to the bone.
She could at least exempt me from this.

00:05:06.870 --> 00:05:08.440
Those are two separate things.

00:05:08.440 --> 00:05:11.200
Things will be getting lively again.

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:12.310
It's Etou-san and the others.

00:05:12.310 --> 00:05:13.710
Weren't they the ones who...

00:05:13.710 --> 00:05:15.700
That's the first time I've 
seen them all together.

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:21.460
Shall we be going, then?

00:05:30.710 --> 00:05:32.970
<b>Today's Star</b>

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:37.090
Happy Birthday!

00:05:37.950 --> 00:05:41.730
Kaoru-chan planned all this, since we 
knew the next time we'd all be together

00:05:41.730 --> 00:05:44.020
would be on your birthday!

00:05:44.020 --> 00:05:47.390
It's a surprise party. 
Well, were you surprised?

00:05:48.400 --> 00:05:51.280
Okay, time for the cake!

00:05:49.020 --> 00:05:51.280
<b>Happy Birthday
 Sayaka-chan</b>

00:05:51.710 --> 00:05:54.660
We got it from a shop that 
Hiyori-chan recommended.

00:05:55.990 --> 00:05:59.510
Shouldn't we have gone with the 
chocolate mint cake instead?

00:05:59.510 --> 00:06:01.870
This is for Sayaka-chan.

00:06:01.870 --> 00:06:04.580
You're the only one who likes chocolate mint.

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:05.990
That's not true.

00:06:05.990 --> 00:06:08.500
You'd make someone eat 
toothpaste on their birthday?

00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:09.790
It's not toothpaste!

00:06:09.790 --> 00:06:12.130
Please blow the candles out with one breath.

00:06:12.130 --> 00:06:15.550
This is the main event
 for today. Give it your all!

00:06:15.550 --> 00:06:16.720
Got it.

00:06:21.030 --> 00:06:23.330
Wait, wait, wait, what're you doing?

00:06:24.100 --> 00:06:27.650
Relax your shoulders more. 
You're going to crush the cake!

00:06:32.260 --> 00:06:34.150
Congratulations!

00:06:35.900 --> 00:06:37.120
Thank you.

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:45.710
So that hooded Toji who's 
been stealing the noro

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:48.340
was definitely Shidou Maki.

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:50.460
Yes, I saw her, too.

00:06:50.460 --> 00:06:52.840
I thought as much.

00:06:52.840 --> 00:06:54.430
Please wait a moment!

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:58.950
Mai-mai and I also fought the hooded 
Toji that stole the noro at Nagakute,

00:06:58.950 --> 00:07:01.260
but that wasn't Maki-maki.

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:05.430
Yes, Shidou-san uses the Shindo Munen style.

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:13.890
I believe that person was 
using a different style.

00:07:14.380 --> 00:07:18.340
Does that mean that she's 
using other techniques

00:07:18.340 --> 00:07:20.080
to try and hide her identity, then?

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:22.280
I don't think so.

00:07:22.280 --> 00:07:25.410
Well, we'd know it was Shidou if we saw her.

00:07:25.410 --> 00:07:28.750
Which means the hooded Toji is not alone.

00:07:30.070 --> 00:07:33.050
Perhaps Sana-sensei would know something?

00:07:34.780 --> 00:07:38.300
Sana-sensei, we have something 
we'd like to know.

00:07:38.300 --> 00:07:40.550
What's with all the fuss?

00:07:40.550 --> 00:07:43.680
Who is the hooded Toji?

00:07:43.680 --> 00:07:47.420
That's not entirely up to me to say...

00:07:48.460 --> 00:07:49.690
Why not?

00:07:50.300 --> 00:07:54.460
I was just thinking it was about 
time that we told you all as well.

00:07:57.580 --> 00:08:01.200
For now, we have confirmed 
that there are two of them.

00:08:03.170 --> 00:08:05.850
One is without a doubt Shidou Maki.

00:08:06.440 --> 00:08:10.580
And the other was never even a Toji.

00:08:10.930 --> 00:08:13.210
Not a Toji? Then...

00:08:13.790 --> 00:08:15.210
It is Princess Tagitsu.

00:08:20.890 --> 00:08:23.650
Princess Tagitsu should've been 
driven back into the netherworld

00:08:23.650 --> 00:08:25.040
in the battle five months ago.

00:08:25.040 --> 00:08:26.850
Has she been revived already?

00:08:27.720 --> 00:08:29.480
Who has she possessed?

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:34.410
No, Princess Tagitsu has not 
possessed anyone this time.

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:37.440
She has manifested as an 
aradama in human form.

00:08:37.440 --> 00:08:39.120
Is that even possible?

00:08:40.940 --> 00:08:42.140
Please enter.

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:44.460
Excuse me.

00:08:48.590 --> 00:08:51.210
There is a message from Ichigaya 
for you, Deputy Director.

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:51.210
<b>Top Secret</b>

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:55.740
This is...

00:08:57.830 --> 00:09:00.030
We finally have permission.

00:09:01.420 --> 00:09:03.430
Etou-san, Juujou-san...

00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:08.680
Please accompany me tomorrow to the 
Ministry of Defense in Ichigaya.

00:09:09.240 --> 00:09:10.650
On an escort mission.

00:09:24.430 --> 00:09:29.330
Um, why do you need an escort 
to the Ministry of Defense?

00:09:30.700 --> 00:09:34.190
I will be meeting with an important person.

00:09:34.190 --> 00:09:36.270
Important person?

00:09:36.270 --> 00:09:38.170
A very important person.

00:09:39.110 --> 00:09:42.750
Honestly, anything could happen.

00:09:43.800 --> 00:09:47.330
That is why I wanted you both to come along.

00:09:48.090 --> 00:09:50.810
Will we be useful to you somehow?

00:09:51.420 --> 00:09:54.310
It has to be the two of you.

00:09:54.700 --> 00:09:56.570
It has to be us?

00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:00.330
Does that mean...

00:10:01.820 --> 00:10:05.830
<b>Ministry of Defense</b>

00:10:21.210 --> 00:10:22.730
We've been expecting you.

00:10:40.510 --> 00:10:42.910
Things are really tense here.

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:45.930
There are even Toji.

00:10:54.310 --> 00:10:55.830
Good work.

00:10:55.830 --> 00:10:58.340
Takako-san! Satomi-san!

00:10:58.340 --> 00:10:59.730
It's been a while.

00:10:59.730 --> 00:11:01.170
Why are you both here?

00:11:01.630 --> 00:11:03.730
We were assigned here yesterday.

00:11:04.230 --> 00:11:05.410
Be careful.

00:11:52.360 --> 00:11:54.060
Please stand down.

00:11:57.630 --> 00:12:00.560
We are honored to be granted 
an audience with you,

00:12:01.340 --> 00:12:02.560
Princess Tagitsu.

00:12:03.830 --> 00:12:06.710
That name is used by another.

00:12:06.710 --> 00:12:08.110
What shall I call you?

00:12:09.230 --> 00:12:12.620
You are permitted to call me Princess Takiri.

00:12:12.620 --> 00:12:15.270
As you wish. I am—

00:12:15.270 --> 00:12:21.090
Origami Akane, along with Etou 
Kanami and Juujou Hiyori.

00:12:22.110 --> 00:12:25.490
Princess Takiri, I will speak frankly.

00:12:26.040 --> 00:12:29.260
Do you mean to do us harm?

00:12:29.550 --> 00:12:31.260
Questions are not permitted.

00:12:32.380 --> 00:12:35.550
Give me Princess Ichikishima.

00:12:37.320 --> 00:12:40.520
I know that she is in your keeping.

00:12:43.180 --> 00:12:46.450
The true ruin of humanity 
is Princess Tagitsu.

00:12:47.070 --> 00:12:51.540
And humans cannot bear the 
ideals of Princess Ichikishima.

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:53.910
Why should we do as you ask?

00:12:54.320 --> 00:12:56.450
I am Princess Takiri.

00:12:56.450 --> 00:12:59.790
A deity who leads those lost in fog.

00:13:00.440 --> 00:13:06.800
Humans, I will bring you the 
best value that you seek.

00:13:07.530 --> 00:13:10.560
Princess Tagitsu is gaining strength.

00:13:11.030 --> 00:13:13.370
Time is limited.

00:13:23.430 --> 00:13:24.910
Akane-sama!

00:13:24.910 --> 00:13:26.570
I am all right.

00:13:27.480 --> 00:13:31.650
<i>My sister suppressed something 
like this all by herself.</i>

00:13:48.310 --> 00:13:52.800
Akane-sama, well, just what is going on?

00:13:52.800 --> 00:13:54.450
Please tell us!

00:13:55.870 --> 00:13:57.350
All right, then.

00:13:58.710 --> 00:14:02.990
After you destroyed the great 
aradama inside my sister,

00:14:02.990 --> 00:14:04.600
it was split into three parts.

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:10.210
The one we just met was Princess Takiri,

00:14:10.210 --> 00:14:13.060
the one gathering the noro from 
various places is Princess Tagitsu,

00:14:13.060 --> 00:14:16.160
and one other is Princess Ichikishima.

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:20.030
Our thinking was wrong.

00:14:20.550 --> 00:14:24.830
My sister's body was not just being 
controlled by the great aradama.

00:14:25.450 --> 00:14:28.840
She was using her body to 
suppress it all this time.

00:14:29.130 --> 00:14:33.150
And now that they are acting 
freely of their own will,

00:14:33.150 --> 00:14:35.440
each seeking their respective objectives.

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:38.090
It is an extremely dangerous situation.

00:14:39.710 --> 00:14:43.990
A portion of the government does 
not want to let Princess Takiri go.

00:14:43.990 --> 00:14:46.110
But that makes things difficult.

00:14:46.510 --> 00:14:49.940
That is not something humans 
can do anything about.

00:14:52.010 --> 00:14:55.740
Is it true that we have Princess Ichikishima?

00:14:56.300 --> 00:15:00.240
Yes, she is being kept absolutely safe.

00:15:06.330 --> 00:15:08.640
Ayumu, it's break time.

00:15:11.340 --> 00:15:14.290
You've been working really 
hard lately, Ayumu.

00:15:14.290 --> 00:15:19.550
I made a promise to Etou-san that 
we'd fight together someday.

00:15:19.550 --> 00:15:24.560
So I need to keep practicing and 
get stronger, just like Etou-san!

00:15:24.560 --> 00:15:27.560
You really admire Etou-san, don't you?

00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:28.470
Yep.

00:15:28.470 --> 00:15:31.950
We were pretty useless in our 
first battle, weren't we?

00:15:31.950 --> 00:15:34.820
You're right, we couldn't really do anything.

00:15:35.150 --> 00:15:37.070
But next time will be different!

00:15:37.070 --> 00:15:39.200
I'll be able to fight properly.

00:15:39.200 --> 00:15:42.370
Okay, then. I'll thoroughly
 spar with you today!

00:15:42.370 --> 00:15:44.200
Thanks, Miya.

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:48.610
What is going on with the 
candidate selection process?

00:15:48.610 --> 00:15:49.950
They are being reviewed.

00:15:49.950 --> 00:15:52.390
How much longer are you 
going to keep me waiting?!

00:15:52.390 --> 00:15:55.120
The princess is already making her move!

00:15:55.120 --> 00:15:56.300
I am aware.

00:15:56.710 --> 00:16:00.800
You haven't lost your nerve this 
late in the game, have you?

00:16:03.390 --> 00:16:05.580
I won't be kept waiting any longer!

00:16:11.900 --> 00:16:14.130
You are an unfair person.

00:16:31.230 --> 00:16:32.850
Let's stop for now.

00:16:33.880 --> 00:16:36.590
You're not into practicing at all, are you?

00:16:36.590 --> 00:16:38.540
That's not like you.

00:16:39.950 --> 00:16:41.580
What's wrong with you today?

00:16:42.870 --> 00:16:46.670
I wonder if what we did was pointless.

00:16:46.670 --> 00:16:48.390
Defeating Yukari?

00:16:48.390 --> 00:16:49.530
Yeah.

00:16:49.530 --> 00:16:50.940
Why do you think that?

00:16:50.940 --> 00:16:55.050
I mean, things have gotten even 
more mixed-up than before.

00:16:55.610 --> 00:16:58.320
It's made me even more unsure.

00:16:58.630 --> 00:17:02.320
Would you rather have abandoned 
your friends like that, then?

00:17:02.670 --> 00:17:03.790
No!

00:17:03.790 --> 00:17:05.050
Then it's fine.

00:17:05.050 --> 00:17:07.050
I guess...

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:11.120
Besides, when you say that,

00:17:11.120 --> 00:17:16.170
it makes me feel bad for not defeating 
the great aradama at Enoshima.

00:17:16.170 --> 00:17:19.090
It's not your fault, Mo—Master!

00:17:19.090 --> 00:17:21.590
Then you're not to blame, either.

00:17:21.590 --> 00:17:24.210
See and feel things for yourself,

00:17:24.210 --> 00:17:26.550
and if you still don't 
understand, try fighting.

00:17:27.670 --> 00:17:29.930
Worry is also an important part of training.

00:17:30.520 --> 00:17:31.410
Okay.

00:17:31.810 --> 00:17:33.170
Hang in there.

00:17:42.450 --> 00:17:45.910
Today is the security mission 
at Ichigaya with Hiyori-chan!

00:17:55.450 --> 00:17:56.920
Shidou-san...

00:17:56.920 --> 00:18:01.360
So if she came here, does that 
mean she's after Princess Takiri?

00:18:01.360 --> 00:18:04.930
We'll need to stop her before 
she makes a mess of things.

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:09.150
I can't believe it's turned out like this.

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:10.030
Yeah.

00:18:10.870 --> 00:18:12.430
You okay?

00:18:12.430 --> 00:18:16.340
If I'm being honest, I still 
haven't sorted out how I feel yet.

00:18:16.340 --> 00:18:21.440
I thought things were over when we tore 
Princess Tagitsu away from Origami Yukari.

00:18:22.220 --> 00:18:26.300
Hiyori-chan, do you think
 Princess Takiri has to be cut down?

00:18:27.420 --> 00:18:31.950
I do, but what do you think?

00:18:31.950 --> 00:18:33.710
Me?

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:35.550
I...

00:18:35.550 --> 00:18:39.510
I tried to remember what I felt yesterday,

00:18:39.510 --> 00:18:41.600
and I can't really explain it,

00:18:41.600 --> 00:18:45.040
but Princess Takiri somehow felt 
different from the Princess Tagitsu

00:18:45.040 --> 00:18:46.990
that we fought before.

00:19:37.600 --> 00:19:41.110
Oodenta and Onimaru? Princess Tagitsu?

00:19:41.880 --> 00:19:44.430
Chidori and Kogarasumaru...

00:19:44.430 --> 00:19:48.860
It must be fate that keeps
 bringing us together.

00:19:50.090 --> 00:19:51.760
I will destroy you this time!

00:19:55.200 --> 00:19:57.620
I can see everything.

00:19:57.620 --> 00:19:58.540
I won't let you!

00:20:02.140 --> 00:20:05.170
Why do you protect Princess Takiri?

00:20:05.760 --> 00:20:09.760
I will not allow you mere 
humans to come between us.

00:20:09.760 --> 00:20:10.590
Kanami!

00:20:16.020 --> 00:20:17.430
Princess Tagitsu!

00:20:17.430 --> 00:20:19.310
Shidou-san?!

00:20:48.810 --> 00:20:50.300
She disappeared?

00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:55.180
This is...

00:20:58.030 --> 00:20:59.770
What does this mean?

00:20:59.770 --> 00:21:01.330
There's another one?

00:21:07.500 --> 00:21:08.780
Shidou-san, wait!

00:21:14.440 --> 00:21:15.810
Juujou...

00:21:26.540 --> 00:21:27.350
Princess!

00:21:27.350 --> 00:21:28.420
Don't concern yourself.

00:21:29.610 --> 00:21:31.070
Chidori, hm?

00:21:32.510 --> 00:21:36.380
There were hindrances.
 Prepare the pieces immediately.

00:21:38.220 --> 00:21:39.130
Yes.

00:21:45.110 --> 00:21:48.940
Princess Tagitsu has learned 
where Princess Takiri is.

00:22:02.780 --> 00:22:03.930
<i>Nee-sama...</i>

00:23:34.920 --> 00:23:39.930
<b>Next Episode  The Goddesses' Madness</b>
